Scoped FMOD Sample Bank (FSB) demuxer

The fsb_probe magic and sample-count check, the version 3 header fields
(data offset RL32@8 + 0x18, duration RL32@56, format RL32@72, rate RL32@76,
channels RL16@86), the format-flag order (0x100 pcm_s16le before the IMA,
PSX and THP ADPCM flags), the absolute data seek and the
4096*channels-byte av_get_packet block in src/fsb.ts follow
libavformat/fsb.c (fsb_probe, fsb_read_header, fsb_read_packet).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
